--TEST--
an `extend` block names its type with `self::`: `static::`, `parent::` and `new static` in its body are `E0338`, and so is `yield` in an added static method or in a block on an enum — `rule:classes/an-extend-block-adds-members-to-a-type`
--FILE--
<?nvs
use Core\Time\Date;
use Core\Audience;

extend Date as Days {
    public static function first(): Date {
        return static::at(2026, 1, 1);
    }

    public static function copy(): Date {
        return new static();
    }

    public function before(): Date {
        return parent::at(2026, 1, 1);
    }

    public static function months(): Iterator<int> {
        yield 1;
    }
}

extend Audience as Audiences {
    public function names(): Iterator<string> {
        yield "one";
    }
}

echo "unreachable\n";
// covers: lang:classes/extend-blocks
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0338]: an `extend` block cannot use `static::`
  --> %s:7:16
  |
7 |         return static::at(2026, 1, 1);
  |                ^^^^^^ not allowed in an `extend` block
  = help: write `self::`. In an `extend` block, `self` is the extended type, and an added member is never inherited

error[E0338]: an `extend` block cannot use `new static`
   --> %s:11:16
   |
11 |         return new static();
   |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^ not allowed in an `extend` block
   = help: write `new self`. In an `extend` block, `self` is the extended type, and an added member is never inherited
%A
error[E0338]: an `extend` block cannot use `parent::`
   --> %s:15:16
   |
15 |         return parent::at(2026, 1, 1);
   |                ^^^^^^ not allowed in an `extend` block
%A
error[E0338]: an `extend` block cannot add a method that uses `yield` here
   --> %s:18:28
   |
18 |     public static function months(): Iterator<int> {
   |                            ^^^^^^ not allowed in an `extend` block
   = help: return an array from the method. An added static method, and an added method of an enum, cannot use `yield`

error[E0338]: an `extend` block cannot add a method that uses `yield` here
   --> %s:24:21
   |
24 |     public function names(): Iterator<string> {
   |                     ^^^^^ not allowed in an `extend` block
%A
error: aborting due to 6 errors
